IMO this is a problem with the ComplexHeatmap package. The Repository field should not be populated by the package:

https://github.com/jokergoo/ComplexHeatmap/blob/master/DESCRIPTION#L22

I would file a PR to remove that field from the DESCRIPTION, and then install the package from GitHub.

-Andy

