In R

devtools::install_github(‘thomasp85/PanVizGenerator’)
library(PanVizGenerator)
PanVizGenerator()

to launch the gui.

Then download the example data (link on the right side) and use this as input in the file input box (notice the nice formatting in relation to issue #760 :-)

Accept the default setting and press generate, let it churn a but and when it’s done press download - this is when things go south…

All serverside functionality resides in PanVizGenerator:::server

